=== REASONING ===
The API no longer returns fsm_type or mode fields on FSMTransition objects.
The page has 40+ references to these fields across:
  - fsmType state variable and FSM Type filter dropdown
  - fsm_type column in transition log table
  - FSM Type and Mode fields in transition detail panel
  - Pie chart dual-mode (by type vs by state)
  - Summary rows grouped by fsm_type
  - FSM Types Seen stat card
  - FSMBadge usage (shows fsm_type)
  - StateBadge fsmType prop

Plan (all within StateMachineDebuggerPage.tsx):
1. Remove fsmType state, FSM_TYPE_OPTIONS import, FSMType type import
2. Remove FSMBadge import, remove Layers icon import
3. Hardcode 'all' in useFSMTransitions hook call
4. Pie chart: always group by to_state (remove dual-mode)
5. Summary rows: group by to_state instead of fsm_type
6. Summary columns: show StateBadge instead of FSMBadge
7. Timeline columns: remove fsm_type column, remove fsmType from StateBadge
8. Remove FSM Type filter Select
9. Replace FSM Types Seen stat card with Total Transitions
10. Transition detail: remove FSM Type and Mode fields
11. Pass transformed transitions to FSMTimelineChart (set fsm_type=to_state)
12. Pass hardcoded values to child components (FSMSubFSMPanel, FSMStateDiagram)

